"""Standalone Windows contained-worker supervisor; root cleanup-repair candidate.

Import is side-effect free: no _winapi, ctypes, WinDLL, or processes at import.
Process fixtures still require Windows and RUN_CONTAINMENT_FIXTURES=1. This module does not import PyRe.
Explicit terminate is the default. No kill-on-close is installed unless requested.
Closing the controller job handle is not a drain certificate. Without a cooperating
wrapper holding its own job handle, controller loss is UNKNOWN_INTERRUPTED.
No PID reattach and no replay.
Derived from Qwen 6bb4e7ed; root edits address independently reproduced cleanup
and terminal-commit failures. Not admitted for native or production execution.
Revision 2 avoids terminating a process whose retained handle is already signaled;
the original nonzero-exit failure and native Winerror-5 trace remain preserved.
